# .htaccess - Apache rules for project2 (Le Cong Binh, RWP-136)

# Template (.inc) and database (.sql) files are only meant to be included
# or imported, never opened in the browser. Apache would otherwise show
# their source code as plain text, so we refuse direct requests for them.
<FilesMatch "\.(inc|sql|md)$">
  Require all denied
</FilesMatch>

# Do not list folder contents (e.g. /project2/images/ or /project2/database/)
Options -Indexes
